WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.408 --> 00:00:07.536
On the precious day you send off your child, tears are a natural emotion.

2
00:00:07.872 --> 00:00:14.880
To prevent smudging, we use strong waterproof formulas for all eye makeup — mascara, eyeliner, everything —

3
00:00:15.216 --> 00:00:19.152
carefully filling in between the lashes to minimize any risk of running.

4
00:00:19.488 --> 00:00:26.352
The outer corners, where tears tend to pool, are set with a matte finish to prevent "black tears."

5
00:00:26.688 --> 00:00:33.072
If tears do fall during the ceremony, don't rub — gently dab them with a handkerchief instead,

6
00:00:33.408 --> 00:00:38.184
and if you're worried, tuck a soft gauze cloth into your hanbok sleeve beforehand.

7
00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:44.496
Emotions run highest during the moment the bride and groom bow to their parents —

8
00:00:44.832 --> 00:00:50.952
at that moment, avoiding direct eye contact and thinking of something else you've practiced can help hold back the tears.
